{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "55f58623-d73c-8281-bb42-81f3ccefe2ce",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:52:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:49:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Terrence McCarthy here. So I've got a question that's either very simple or I'm just bad at reading a calendar, and honestly it's about fifty-fifty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, let's see what we can sort out. What's going on, Mr. McCarthy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody on my street has decided the corner is their personal dumpster. There's a pile of trash bags sitting there, maybe five or six of them, and they've been there since the weekend. I'm pretty sure a neighbor put them out, I saw him do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And where is the corner you're talking about? What's the address, or the nearest one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 253 Bacheller Street, in the Fifth Ward. The bags are right at the corner, just down from my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two fifty-three Bacheller Street. Got it. And the bags have been sitting there since about the weekend, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, since Sunday, I'd say. Right after that nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. I figured maybe the storm threw off the pickup schedule, so I didn't say anything. But they're still there, and I'd rather not have them blow open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:50:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Bags out in the open like that can tear up. Let me pull up your route. Is your regular day Thursday, or am I guessing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday, I believe. Tomorrow, right? See, this is where the calendar skills come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:51:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Yes, I'm showing Thursday for Bacheller Street. So tomorrow is your next pickup. Now, if those bags aren't in the proper city bin or bag, the crew may leave them, so I'll put in a note for someone to take a look at that corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:51:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. I'd honestly haul them myself, but my car's not going to cooperate. I'm saving up for a used pickup truck, so for now it's me and a hatchback that smells like old coffee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with the truck fund. So I'm noting bags dumped at the corner near 253 Bacheller, a neighbor put them out, and you'd like them checked before Thursday's pickup. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back once someone's looked at it? I have a number here ending in zero one five eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:51:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five eight, that's me. A call back would be fine, but no big deal if not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:52:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it either way. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:52:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that's all. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. McCarthy. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
